{"id": 50245, "field": "description", "ja": "$N1秒間、ターゲットをその場に\n釘付けにします。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1584"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": [], "extra": {"short": "その場に釘付けにされている。"}}
{"id": 50256, "field": "description", "ja": "熊(Bear)の咆哮は、$N3秒間、$N1\nヤード以内の全ての敵が与える物理\nダメージを$N2%減少させます。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1585"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": [], "extra": {"short": "物理ダメージが$N1%減少。"}}
{"id": 50274, "field": "description", "ja": "近くの敵に胞子をまぶし、$N3秒間、\n$N1ヤード以内の全ての敵の魔法詠唱\n速度を$N2%遅くします。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1586"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": [], "extra": {"short": "詠唱速度が$N1%低下。"}}
{"id": 50285, "field": "description", "ja": "目つぶしの砂煙を蹴立てて、$N3\n秒間、$N1ヤード以内の全ての敵の\n近接攻撃速度と遠隔攻撃速度を$N2%\n減少します。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1587"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 50300, "field": "description", "ja": "Northrendの薬草の見つけ方と集め\n方。herbalismスキルを450まで拡張する。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1588"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 50305, "field": "description", "ja": "Leatherworkingに使う皮を獣から\n剥ぎ取る達人技。skinningスキルを\n450まで拡張する。Skinning Knifeが\n必要。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1589"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 50310, "field": "description", "ja": "あなたは偉大な採掘の達人です。\n採掘の最大スキルを450まで拡張します。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1590"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 50318, "field": "description", "ja": "蛾の羽から鱗粉の煙が発生し、敵の\n魔法詠唱を中断させ、さらに$N1\n秒間、詠唱中だった属性の魔法の\n詠唱を妨げます。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1591"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 50433, "field": "description", "ja": "対象の足に飛びつき、$N2秒間、移動\n速度を$N1%減少させます。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1592"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": [], "extra": {"short": "移動速度が$N1%低下。"}}
{"id": 50479, "field": "description", "ja": "敵を瞬時に攻撃し、敵の魔法詠唱を\n中断させ、さらに$N1秒間、詠唱\n中だった属性の魔法の詠唱を妨げます。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1593"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 50498, "field": "description", "ja": "敵のarmorを鉤爪で切り裂き、armor\n効果を$N1%減少させます。効果は$N2\n回までスタックします。$N3秒間\n有効。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1594"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 50518, "field": "description", "ja": "敵を激しく攻撃し、$N2秒間、敵に\n与える物理ダメージを$N1%増加します。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1595"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": [], "extra": {"short": "与える物理ダメージが$N1%増加。"}}
{"id": 50519, "field": "description", "ja": "つんざくような金切り声を発し、\nターゲットを$N1秒間気絶(stun)\nさせます。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1596"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": [], "extra": {"short": "気絶(Stun)状態。"}}
{"id": 50541, "field": "description", "ja": "猛禽が敵の武器をかぎ爪で掴み、$N1\n秒間、武器(メインハンド武器と遠隔\n武器)を持てないようにします。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1597"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": [], "extra": {"short": "非武装状態。"}}
{"id": 50613, "field": "description", "ja": "8ヤード以内にいるすべての敵を2秒間\nSilence状態にし、Manaを6%回復します。\nNPCを対象とする場合は魔法詠唱を3\n秒間妨害します。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1598"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": [], "extra": {"short": "沈黙(Silence)状態。"}}
{"id": 50769, "field": "description", "ja": "魂を肉体に戻し、死者を総healthと総\nmanaの$N1%の状態で復活させます。\n戦闘中には使えません。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1599"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 50842, "field": "description", "ja": "$N1 Shadow属性ダメージを$N2ヤード範囲の\n全ての敵に与え、対象の感染している\ndiseaseを攻撃の当たった全員に感染拡大させます。\n\n", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#1600"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
